    "title": "Projected regional-scale changes in atmospheric stability condition for the development of summertime convective precipitation in the Tokyo metropolitan area under global warming",
    "venue": {
        "name": "Hydrological Research Letters",
        "id": "https://openalex.org/S145113930",
